# --- Build outputs: NEVER commit these ---------------------------------
# ~980 MB of gate/probe binaries were committed by accident (several by me,
# via `git add -A` in a worktree where a gate image had just been built).
# Each one materialises in EVERY worktree, so at ~1 GB per worktree this
# filled the box to 100% three times in one session and forced an agent to
# use `git sparse-checkout` to work at all.
#
# Build images belong in /tmp or under an ignored path — see mvm/BUILDS.md
# and MODUS_ANSI_OUT (which exists precisely so gate builds land outside
# the worktree).
modus-ansi-*
modus-aa64-*
gate-off
gate-jit
gate-*.out
modus-base
modus-fix*
modus-p[0-9]*
modus-206*
*.bin
*.img
*.efi
